        "review": "I have only just started playing this classic gamebook-turned-digital. I'll recommend it just because its Heart of Ice, after all. But this adaptation leaves some things to be desired:\n\n1) Most illustrations don't match the narrative. This is a weird decision by the designers.\n2) In a digital format, the reference to pages AND to chapters becomes unnecessary and confusing.\n\nI get that the desginers went for an as-close-to-a-physical-book as possible, but this adaptation is rushed. See the Fighting Fantasy app for a better example of how to turn classic gamebooks into digital games.",
